  {
    "id": "story-w4",
    "hanzi": "晚上，我看见窗外有一颗星。小猫走到窗前，安静地看着天空。我把这个发现记在本子上。",
    "pinyinMarked": "Wǎnshang, wǒ kànjiàn chuāngwài yǒu yī kē xīng. Xiǎomāo zǒu dào chuāng qián, ānjìng de kànzhe tiānkōng. Wǒ bǎ zhège fāxiàn jì zài běnzi shàng.",
    "pinyinPlain": "wanshangwokanjianchuangwaiyouyikexingxiaomaozoudaochuangqiananjingdekanzhetiankongwobazhegefaxianjizaibenzishang",
    "audio": "story-w4",
    "introducedIn": 16
  },
  {
    "id": "story-robot",
    "hanzi": "机器人停在门前。它听见铃声，却没有开门。我检查电脑上的指令，发现方向写错了。改好以后，它向右转，再走两步，终于找到了入口。",
    "pinyinMarked": "Jīqìrén tíng zài mén qián. Tā tīngjiàn língshēng, què méiyǒu kāi mén. Wǒ jiǎnchá diànnǎo shàng de zhǐlìng, fāxiàn fāngxiàng xiě cuò le. Gǎi hǎo yǐhòu, tā xiàng yòu zhuǎn, zài zǒu liǎng bù, zhōngyú zhǎodào le rùkǒu.",
    "pinyinPlain": "jiqirentingzaimenqiantatingjianlingshengquemeiyoukaimenwojianchadiannaoshangdezhilingfaxianfangxiangxiecuolegaihaoyihoutaxiangyouzhuanzaizouliangbuzhongyuzhaodaolerukou",
    "audio": "story-robot",
    "introducedIn": 21
  },
  {
    "id": "story-stars",
    "hanzi": "夜里，天空很清楚。我和朋友走到窗前，看到几颗明亮的星。我们没有急着猜名字，先画下它们的位置，再查星图。原来，仔细观察也能解开一个小谜题。",
    "pinyinMarked": "Yèlǐ, tiānkōng hěn qīngchu. Wǒ hé péngyou zǒu dào chuāng qián, kàndào jǐ kē míngliàng de xīng. Wǒmen méiyǒu jí zhe cāi míngzi, xiān huà xià tāmen de wèizhi, zài chá xīngtú. Yuánlái, zǐxì guānchá yě néng jiěkāi yī gè xiǎo mítí.",
    "pinyinPlain": "yelitiankonghenqingchuwohepengyouzoudaochuangqiankandaojikemingliangdexingwomenmeiyoujizhecaimingzixianhuaxiatamendeweizhizaichaxingtuyuanlaizixiguanchayenengjiekaiyigexiaomiti",
    "audio": "story-stars",
    "introducedIn": 21
  },
  {
    "id": "message-week5",
    "hanzi": "今天我和朋友在学校看了一本机器人的书。我们想做一个实验，先写下步骤，再用电脑记录结果。",
    "pinyinMarked": "Jīntiān wǒ hé péngyou zài xuéxiào kàn le yī běn jīqìrén de shū. Wǒmen xiǎng zuò yī gè shíyàn, xiān xiě xià bùzhòu, zài yòng diànnǎo jìlù jiéguǒ.",
    "pinyinPlain": "jintianwohepengyouzaixuexiaokanleyibenjiqirendeshuwomenxiangzuoyigeshiyanxianxiexiabuzhouzaiyongdiannaojilujieguo",
    "audio": "message-week5",
    "introducedIn": 20
  },
  {
    "id": "message-invention",
    "hanzi": "我最感兴趣的发明是机器人。它可以帮助人们搬东西，也可以在危险的地方工作。我想设计一个给植物浇水的机器人，先检查土壤是否干燥，再决定要不要加水。这样既方便，也能节约用水。",
    "pinyinMarked": "Wǒ zuì gǎn xìngqù de fāmíng shì jīqìrén. Tā kěyǐ bāngzhù rénmen bān dōngxi, yě kěyǐ zài wēixiǎn de dìfang gōngzuò. Wǒ xiǎng shèjì yī gè gěi zhíwù jiāo shuǐ de jīqìrén, xiān jiǎnchá tǔrǎng shìfǒu gānzào, zài juédìng yào bu yào jiā shuǐ. Zhèyàng jì fāngbiàn, yě néng jiéyuē yòng shuǐ.",
    "pinyinPlain": "wozuiganxingqudefamingshijiqirentakeyibangzhurenmenbandongxiyekeyizaiweixiandedifanggongzuowoxiangshejiyigegeizhiwujiaoshuidejiqirenxianjianchaturangshifouganzaozaijuedingyaobuyaojiashuizheyangjifangbianyenengjieyueyongshui",
    "audio": "message-invention",
    "introducedIn": 23
  },
  {
    "id": "message-final",
    "hanzi": "今天我用电脑记录了一个有趣的发现。窗边的植物总是向着光生长，我想知道换一个位置会怎样。明天我会把花盆转一下，拍照并写下变化。一周以后，再比较照片，看看我的猜想对不对。",
    "pinyinMarked": "Jīntiān wǒ yòng diànnǎo jìlù le yī gè yǒuqù de fāxiàn. Chuāng biān de zhíwù zǒngshì xiàngzhe guāng shēngzhǎng, wǒ xiǎng zhīdào huàn yī gè wèizhi huì zěnyàng. Míngtiān wǒ huì bǎ huāpén zhuǎn yī xià, pāizhào bìng xiě xià biànhuà. Yī zhōu yǐhòu, zài bǐjiào zhàopiàn, kànkan wǒ de cāixiǎng duì bu duì.",
    "pinyinPlain": "jintianwoyongdiannaojiluleyigeyouqudefaxianchuangbiandezhiwuzongshixiangzheguangshengzhangwoxiangzhidaohuanyigeweizhihuizenyangmingtianwohuibahuapenzhuanyixiapaizhaobingxiexiabianhuayizhouyihouzaibijiaozhaopiankankanwodecaixiangduibudui",
    "audio": "message-final",
    "introducedIn": 24
  },
  {
    "id": "story-final",
    "hanzi": "周末，我和朋友在公园里看见一只小鸟。它停在树枝上，轻轻地叫。我们没有走近，而是站在远处，用本子记下它的颜色和声音。",
    "pinyinMarked": "Zhōumò, wǒ hé péngyou zài gōngyuán lǐ kànjiàn yī zhī xiǎoniǎo. Tā tíng zài shùzhī shàng, qīngqīng de jiào. Wǒmen méiyǒu zǒu jìn, ér shì zhàn zài yuǎn chù, yòng běnzi jì xià tā de yánsè hé shēngyīn.",
    "pinyinPlain": "zhoumowohepengyouzaigongyuanlikanjianyizhixiaoniaotatingzaishuzhishangqingqingdejiaowomenmeiyouzoujinershizhanzaiyuanchuyongbenzijixiatadeyanseheshengyin",
